  "observations": [
    "Initial node image transfer exhausted the shared bootstrap budget; image preparation is now a separate bounded phase.",
    "Cold file-page waits were observed in containerd/etcd. kind v0.33 uses kubeadm v1beta4 only for Kubernetes >=1.36; the locked 1.36.4 profile uses a 4m API bootstrap budget.",
    "A host loopback proxy inherited by nodes caused ImagePullBackOff. Only the kind child proxy environment is changed; host settings remain untouched.",
    "A Job delete response did not guarantee Pod deletion. Foreground propagation and a bounded Pod convergence check are required.",
    "kind could alter its kubeconfig even when a node deletion failed. Deletion now uses a separate empty kubeconfig and retains retryable ownership; a prototype-state recovery was recorded separately.",
    "Earlier attempts used evolving code/configuration. Every phase of the last completed cycle records the current implementation hash."
  ],
